<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Verify Your Email</title>
  </head>
  <body
    style="
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: #f9fafb;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    "
  >
    <table
      width="100%"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      style="background-color: #f9fafb; padding: 40px 10px"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            width="100%"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            style="
              max-width: 600px;
              background: #ffffff;
              border-radius: 24px;
              overflow: hidden;
              box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
              border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            "
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="
                  padding: 60px 40px 30px 40px;
                  background: linear-gradient(
                    to bottom,
                    #f5f3ff 0%,
                    #ffffff 100%
                  );
                "
              >
                <div style="margin-bottom: 20px">
                  <img
                    src="https://d1dmb2897axey0.cloudfront.net/default/logo.png"
                    alt="Arts & Craft Studio"
                    width="120"
                    style="display: block; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 15px"
                  />
                </div>

                <h1
                  style="
                    color: #1f2937;
                    margin: 0;
                    font-size: 28px;
                    font-weight: 800;
                    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
                    text-align: center;
                  "
                >
                  Arts & Craft Studio
                </h1>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 50px; text-align: center">
                <div
                  style="
                    display: inline-block;
                    padding: 6px 16px;
                    background-color: #e0e7ff;
                    color: #4338ca;
                    border-radius: 30px;
                    font-size: 13px;
                    font-weight: 700;
                    text-transform: uppercase;
                    margin-bottom: 25px;
                  "
                >
                  🎨 Welcome to the Studio
                </div>

                <h2
                  style="
                    color: #111827;
                    font-size: 32px;
                    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
                    line-height: 1.1;
                    font-weight: 800;
                  "
                >
                  Let's verify your email
                </h2>

                <p
                  style="
                    color: #4b5563;
                    font-size: 17px;
                    line-height: 1.6;
                    margin: 0;
                  "
                >
                  Hi <strong><%= name %></strong>, <br />
                  Ready to start creating? Please click the button below to
                  confirm your email and unlock your full Arts & Craft Studio
                  experience.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td align="center" style="padding: 45px 50px">
                <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
                  <tr>
                    <td
                      align="center"
                      style="
                        background-color: #6366f1;
                        border-radius: 14px;
                        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
                      "
                    >
                      <a
                        href="<%= redirectUrl %>"
                        style="
                          display: inline-block;
                          padding: 20px 45px;
                          font-size: 18px;
                          color: #ffffff;
                          text-decoration: none;
                          font-weight: bold;
                          letter-spacing: 0.5px;
                        "
                      >
                        Verify My Account
                      </a>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </table>
                <p style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 14px; color: #9ca3af">
                  Button not working? Use the link in the footer below.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0 50px">
                <div
                  style="height: 1px; background-color: #f3f4f6; width: 100%"
                ></div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 40px 50px; text-align: center">
                <p
                  style="
                    font-size: 13px;
                    color: #6b7280;
                    margin-bottom: 10px;
                    line-height: 1.5;
                  "
                >
                  <strong>Quick Link:</strong><br />
                  <a
                    href="<%= redirectUrl %>"
                    style="
                      color: #6366f1;
                      text-decoration: underline;
                      word-break: break-all;
                    "
                    ><%= redirectUrl %></a
                  >
                </p>

                <p
                  style="
                    font-size: 12px;
                    color: #9ca3af;
                    margin: 30px 0 0 0;
                    line-height: 1.5;
                  "
                >
                  &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Art&Craft Studio
                  Inc.<br />
                  You’re receiving this because you’re about to be awesome.
                </p>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>

          <table width="100%" style="max-width: 600px; margin-top: 25px">
            <tr>
              <td
                align="center"
                style="font-size: 12px; color: #9ca3af; padding-bottom: 20px"
              >
                If you didn't request this email, you can safely ignore it.
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
